# Shuffle, part 2: Shuffle Play shuffles the whole card, not the current folder.
#
# mod33 (music service) treats play modes 0-3 (Repeat All, Loop Once,
# Sequential, Shuffle) as folder-scoped unless "Folder Jumping Song" adds 4.
# Playing from Folder Navigation with Shuffle therefore reshuffles one folder
# forever (~100 tracks). The shuffle itself (lazy Fisher-Yates over the
# playlist, mod33 0x03080512) is fine. Make mode 3 behave like mode 7.

# "cmp r0,#2; it ne; cmpne r0,#3; beq <folder scope>" -> cmpne r0,#2
33:03082968:02                  # MusicInit
33:03083026:02                  # msg 0x113, folder navigation (type 99): old mode
33:03083042:02
33:03083060:02
33:030830e4:02                  # msg 0x113, type 10
33:03083100:02
33:03083122:02

# end of track: tbb by play mode, mode 3 -> whole-medium path 0x03081844 (as modes 4, 7)
33:030817a9:4f
